  "details": "It was there before this latest update. This is convenient for when one is in conversation with a group and, without rudely triggering my AFK animation repeatedly, wants to refer to content/data on their desktop via the Virtual Desktop interface vs an overlay.\n\nNow, one must launch Launchpad, click into the main settings, navigate to Comfort & Safety, and toggle it there. It was so much more convenient before! Why reduce access to a toggle like that in the radial?\n\nPersonally, I love the radial because I can remain engaged with people while editing settings.\n\nI know it's minor, but I am a fan of adding more functionality to the small, radial menu.",
